# oracle: fixes nve/manifold/rattle and nvt/manifold/rattle on two dynamic groups (the particles whose scaled |vx| has a
# fractional part above 0.5 and the others, re-evaluated every 2 steps) on a sphere of radius 10, 500 LJ particles of
# examples/PACKAGES/manifold/energy/sphere.data
# Native reference: LAMMPS b332f28 built with PKG_MANIFOLD (/store/shuvam/software/lammps-build-manifold/lmp; the installed binary has no MANIFOLD)
# oracle-examples: PACKAGES/manifold/energy/sphere.data
# oracle-compare: thermo=all atoms=all
units           lj
boundary        f f f
read_data       sphere.data
pair_style      lj/smooth/linear 2.5
pair_coeff      * * 1.0 1.0
pair_modify     shift yes
timestep        0.001
velocity        all create 0.8 87287 dist gaussian
variable        up atom (abs(vx)*1e2-floor(abs(vx)*1e2))>0.5
variable        down atom !v_up
group           dyn dynamic all var up every 2
group           dyn2 dynamic all var down every 2
variable        ndyn equal count(dyn)
fix             1 dyn nve/manifold/rattle 1e-8 20 sphere 10.0
fix             2 dyn2 nvt/manifold/rattle 1e-8 20 sphere 10.0 temp 1.0 1.2 0.1 tchain 4
thermo_style    custom step temp pe ke etotal v_ndyn
thermo_modify   format float %.15g
thermo          25
run             200
